<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates fall to 6.63 percent.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates fall to 6.63 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 6.63 percent on Thursday from 7.00 percent on Wednesday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said three banks traded on the market in six reported transactions with a total value of 6.9 million dinars ($9.7 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.708 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
